    '|a||Walking on the beach in Russian: гуляя, прилетев':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Make Russian gerunds yourself on a Baltic beach: гуля́ют becomes гуля́я, прилете́л becomes прилете́в, and не зна́я.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:2erwfx'
    '|a||Ию́ль. A long weekend: Ма́ша и я прилете́ли в Калинингра́д, на Балти́йское мо́ре.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Мы на пля́же. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1afbvg8'
    '|b||Гуля́я по пля́жу, я нашла́ янта́рь!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3320
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:ek5q7m'
    '|a||Пра́вда? Покажи́!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2000
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Вот. Здесь, на берегу́ Балти́йского мо́ря, его́ мно́го.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4040
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Прилете́в сюда́, я сра́зу хоте́л на мо́ре. А тепе́рь не хочу́ уезжа́ть!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Я то́же. Но в понеде́льник на рабо́ту.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3600
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||What did Masha find? (янта́рь = amber)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Я нашла́ янта́рь: amber.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Where is there a lot of amber?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2280
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||На берегу́ Балти́йского мо́ря.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2320
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||How does Tom feel now?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Не хочу́ уезжа́ть!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2280
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||When are Tom and Masha back at work?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||В понеде́льник.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Посмотри́те. Гуля́я по пля́жу: когда́ я гуля́ла.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Прилете́в сюда́: когда́ я прилете́л. You read these in lesson 127. Today you make them.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ud8270'
    '|a||The doing colour, я: at the same time. The done colour, в: first this, then that.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1aqmlkz'
    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Пляж. Песо́к. Волна́, во́лны.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1samwjn'
    '|a||Янта́рь. Most of the world''s amber is here, in the Калинингра́д region.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:132gqz0'
    '|a||Бе́рег. Янта́рь лежи́т на берегу́ мо́ря.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1w49ob0'
    '|a||О́тпуск: у меня́ о́тпуск, три дня.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:qtvkkb'
    '|a||Приро́да здесь о́чень краси́вая.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:y5fjra'
    '|a||Показа́ть, пока́зывать. You know покажи́. Ма́ша пока́зывает мне янта́рь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:7uwv7h'
    '|a||Тепе́рь: when you make one. Когда́ and a verb become одно́ сло́во.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1yxbeca'
    '|a||Они́ гуля́ют. Drop the ют, add я: гуля́я.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:50g7lg'
    '|a||Они́ иду́т: идя́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1odzz1e'
    '|a||Они́ ищу́т. After ж, ш, ч or щ, it''s а: ища́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:lhpspx'
    '|a||A done verb: take the past, swap л for в. Прилете́л: прилете́в.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1y54uy'
    '|a||Показа́л: показа́в.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:svw3sc'
    '|a||Повтори́те: гуля́я, идя́, ища́. Прилете́в, показа́в. That works for most verbs; a few have no such form.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ojvpxd'
    '|a||And with не: не зна́я, not knowing. Не зна́я го́рода, мы до́лго иска́ли пляж.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1wj6fie'
    '|a||One doer for both: мы не зна́ли, мы иска́ли. The gerund''s doer is the sentence''s subject.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:frn6xu'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы. Запо́лните про́пуски.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1upuwgv'
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски: make the gerund.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1haj8t3'
    '|a||Гуля́я по бе́регу, мы говори́ли о Ло́ндоне.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Идя́ на пляж, Ма́ша улыба́лась.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:s7uhe8'
    '|a||Ища́ янта́рь, Ма́ша смотре́ла на песо́к.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:6nd0pn'
    '|a||Прилете́в сюда́, мы сра́зу пое́хали на мо́ре.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:z73w2o'
    '|a||Показа́в мне янта́рь, Ма́ша пошла́ пла́вать. Молоде́ц!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ugsbhf'
    '|a||Тепе́рь напиши́те це́лое предложе́ние.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:humqrx'
    '|a||Напиши́те, with a gerund: Walking on the beach, we found amber.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1ykhu5r'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Гуля́ют: гуля́я.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3800
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Гуля́я по пля́жу, мы нашли́ янта́рь. Мы гуля́ли, мы нашли́: one doer.':
      mp3: 
